[length:05:57]
[ti:Zero Gravity]
[ar:A881]
[al:Star Dome]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:06.25]{ LYBAS }
[00:11.67]I built you a sky
[00:16.20]where the old ghosts used to sleep.
[00:21.30]No cameras.
[00:22.62]No coffins.
[00:26.29]No one watching you weep.
[00:29.71]{ CYNDRA }
[00:31.57]You remembered the dark
[00:36.89]like it carried my shape.
[00:42.29]Then you gave it back to me
[00:47.02]with stars drawn in its place.
[00:50.02]{ LYBAS }
[00:53.62]No gravity to hold my form,
[00:57.00]no floor to make me stand.
[00:59.35]Your name crossed the hangar lights
[01:01.89]and rewrote every plan.
[01:03.64]{ CYNDRA }
[01:04.34]I lost my little sanctuary,
[01:07.40]my frozen saints, my prayers.
[01:09.94]I kept a chapel in my ribs
[01:12.42]and never let it rest.
[01:14.39]{ LYBAS }
[01:15.02]Then I made the ceiling open
[01:16.97]where silence used to be.
[01:19.02]Now the galaxy is breathing
[01:21.85]right above you and me.
[01:23.76]{ CYNDRA }
[01:24.22]I carried every broken altar,
[01:27.07]beneath my skin, my breath.
[01:29.46]Then you touched the dark so gently,
[01:31.77]it forgot to look like death.
[01:34.04]{ LYBAS }
[01:34.66]I never touched you like I wanted.
[01:37.09]I touched you like a vow
[01:39.57]I was never meant to make,
[01:42.14]but cannot give up now.
[01:44.49]{ CYNDRA }
[01:44.96]I didn’t look at you like safety.
[01:47.61]I watched and understood:
[01:49.44]some men build cages out of duty,
[01:52.14]but you built me inside your blood.
[01:55.04][CHORUS]
[01:55.84]This isn’t human.
[01:57.93]This is something better.
[02:00.61]If there is God inside the void,
[02:03.23]it found our names together.
[02:06.24]Zero gravity,
[02:08.09]full weight forever.
[02:10.84]You made a heaven out of loss
[02:13.34]and pulled me to the center.
[02:15.86]{ CYNDRA }
[02:17.09]I don’t have to pray alone.
[02:21.79]I don’t have to break alone.
[02:26.04]Under every artificial star,
[02:30.02]your breath feels like coming home.
[02:33.99]{ LYBAS }
[02:35.68]Your soft hands moved so carefully
[02:37.86]around the wound I hid.
[02:39.75]Not to fix the soul I was,
[02:42.18]but to honor what it did.
[02:45.08]Your brown skin caught the starlight
[02:47.49]like the dark had learned to burn.
[02:49.68]{ CYNDRA }
[02:50.61]For the first time in this room,
[02:52.25]I don’t want the past returned.
[02:54.64]{ LYBAS }
[02:55.45]Call it weakness if you want.
[02:57.63]Call it sin. Call it wrong.
[03:00.04]I call it choosing one clear flame
[03:02.40]after freezing for so long.
[03:04.41]{ CYNDRA }
[03:05.13]You didn’t bring my shrine back.
[03:07.39]You didn’t lie and say I’d heal.
[03:10.03]You gave the dark a window
[03:12.93]and let the stars be real.
[03:15.68]{ LYBAS }
[03:16.44]If love is treason to the code,
[03:18.64]then write my name in ash.
[03:20.86]I won’t survive this as the same man,
[03:24.05]but I won’t take it back.
[03:25.78][CHORUS BOTH]
[03:26.59]This isn’t human.
[03:28.36]This is something better.
[03:31.18]If there is God inside the void,
[03:33.87]it found our names together.
[03:36.78]Zero gravity,
[03:38.80]full weight forever.
[03:41.50]You made a heaven out of loss
[03:44.06]and pulled me to the center.
[03:46.71]{ CYNDRA }
[03:47.79]I don’t have to pray alone.
[03:50.23]{ LYBAS }
[03:50.53]I don’t have to fall alone.
[03:52.86]{ CYNDRA }
[03:53.56]Under every artificial star,
[03:59.48][AMBOS]
[04:00.90]we feel like coming home.
[04:09.43]{ LYBAS }
[04:11.59]I didn’t pray. I didn’t ask.
[04:13.84]I didn’t beg to be forgiven.
[04:15.64]{ CYNDRA }
[04:16.28]I didn’t kneel. I didn’t run.
[04:19.33]I let myself be given.
[04:20.80]{ LYBAS }
[04:21.29]I knew the price.
[04:21.70]{ CYNDRA }
[04:22.36]I knew the scar.
[04:23.76][AMBOS]
[04:24.27]And still we crossed the distance.
[04:26.06]If heaven is a system fault...
[04:29.32]{ LYBAS }
[04:29.72]Then let it spread within us.
[04:32.36]{ LYBAS }
[04:35.34]No floor. No rank.
[04:40.30]No clocks. No cage.
[04:41.74]{ CYNDRA }
[04:42.55]No code. No cold.
[04:45.48]{ LYBAS }
[04:46.71]No gods.
[04:47.87]Only this sacred place.
[04:50.87][AMBOS]
[04:52.27]This isn’t human.
[04:54.25]This is sacrament.
[04:57.10]I would burn the system down
[04:59.83]to live inside this moment.
[05:02.26]Zero gravity,
[05:04.51]all the weight between us.
[05:07.15]If there’s a god inside the void,
[05:09.86]it wrote our names together.
[05:12.77]{ CYNDRA }
[05:13.64]I don’t have to pray alone.
[05:14.98]{ LYBAS }
[05:16.07]I don’t have to fall alone.
[05:18.04]{ CYNDRA }
[05:18.85]Under every artificial star,
[05:24.18][AMBOS]
[05:26.94]we feel like coming home.
[05:33.68]{ LYBAS }
[05:35.16]You made me a sky.
[05:36.26]{ CYNDRA }
[05:38.16]You gave it meaning.
[05:40.99][AMBOS]
[05:41.66]Zero gravity.
[05:43.50]All the weight between us.
